sections.s5d_lld:
```
  interface List<E> { get(i); add(e); remove(i); ... }
  class ArrayList<E> implements List, RandomAccess {
    Object[] elementData;     // contiguous → cache-friendly
    get(i)  → O(1);  insert mid → O(n) shift
  }
  class LinkedList<E> implements List, Deque {
    Node<E> first, last;      // doubly-linked, pointer chasing
    static class Node { E item; Node prev, next; }  // ~40B/node
    get(i) → O(n);  listIterator.add/remove → O(1) at cursor
  }
  // Rule: statements→ArrayList; streaming-edit→LinkedList
  //       FIFO txn queue→ArrayDeque (cache-friendly)
```
